A(('p', '**Step 1. Read the address.** Read Luke 14:25–33 slowly. Write each thing Jesus says in 14:26–27. Then write each thing the builder does in 14:28–30 and each thing the king does in 14:31–32: sitteth down, counteth, hath laid, is not able, consulteth, sendeth, desireth.'))
A(('p', '**Step 2. Mark what Jesus identifies.** In the table below, write what Jesus says each item is. For each item, if the text gives no identification, write the sentence “Jesus does not identify it.”'))
